    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We would appreciate your feedback and suggestions!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/5ae2cb6616044676072f39c0cb44ff52.poster.avif?t=1755481004\" width=800 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/5ae2cb6616044676072f39c0cb44ff52.webm?t=1755481004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/926c6b8965e32a80351993f6d8a26130.poster.avif?t=1755481004\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/926c6b8965e32a80351993f6d8a26130.apng?t=1755481004\" class=\"bb_img\" width=29 height=31 /></picture></span>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Simple but not easy! Move! Avoid the traps! Reach the goal!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/581993b56a3027f7eb0009e49a8c7d4a.poster.avif?t=1755481004\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/581993b56a3027f7eb0009e49a8c7d4a.apng?t=1755481004\" class=\"bb_img\" width=17 height=23 /></picture></span>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>How to Play:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use only your mouse to guide Gemmy across the map to the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not touch any traps, objects, or even the walls!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the game becomes more challenging, testing not only your control skills but also your ability to strategize and find a way through the traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/581993b56a3027f7eb0009e49a8c7d4a.poster.avif?t=1755481004\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/581993b56a3027f7eb0009e49a8c7d4a.apng?t=1755481004\" class=\"bb_img\" width=17 height=23 /></picture></span>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 types of traps, each with unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through these traps, timing your movements carefully to avoid hazards\u2014some even challenge you to pass within a time limit or as the path rotates. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may even find yourself in shifting mazes where the walls constantly change position, making every second count!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps interact with each other, creating even more diverse and unexpected challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/699973e8d082d510c0f11ae5a92d8f33.poster.avif?t=1755481004\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/699973e8d082d510c0f11ae5a92d8f33.apng?t=1755481004\" class=\"bb_img\" width=29 height=29 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/4a06ca007af69dce542e61110f5d359a.poster.avif?t=1755481004\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/4a06ca007af69dce542e61110f5d359a.apng?t=1755481004\" class=\"bb_img\" width=29 height=29 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/804eb02401d260debe16e485044f429e.poster.avif?t=1755481004\" width=39 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/804eb02401d260debe16e485044f429e.webm?t=1755481004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc Accessible to players of any language, even though the system interface is currently available only in English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steady your hands, move with precision, dodge the obstacles, and rush forward at the perfect moment!</p>",
